### 保存系统用户接口测试（带测试数据）
POST http://localhost:8002/sysUser/saveSysUser
Content-Type: application/json
x-blink-appKey:
x-blink-sign:
x-blink-token:
x-blink-timestamp:
x-blink-nonce:
x-blink-loginName:

{
  "requestId": "req-123456",
  "traceId": "trace-789012",
  "version": "1.0",
  "clientIp": "127.0.0.1",
  "source": "web",
  "channel": "pc",
  "timeout": 3000,
  "extensions": {}, // 空对象更规范，建议替换原有的 "" : {}
  "body": {
    "loginName": "test_user001",
    "password": "Test@123456",
    "confirmPassword": "Test@123456",
    "username": "测试用户001",
    "sex": 1,
    "phone": "13800138000",
    "email": "test001@example.com"
  }
}